   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Tomorrow we ship a big version. Today we check the plan. I document the deployment so the team can review it later. If the monitoring fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the release branch first. The result depends on the deployment approval, so I check it twice. I teach the pattern to a new teammate: Today I'd like to present ... I build a full answer around the pattern: The goal of this project is ... The day ends with a clear plan for tomorrow.",
   "tts": "Tomorrow we ship a big version. Today we check the plan. I document the deployment so the team can review it later. If the monitoring fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the release branch first. The result depends on the deployment approval, so I check it twice. I teach the pattern to a new teammate: Today I'd like to present  I build a full answer around the pattern: The goal of this project is  The day ends with a clear plan for tomorrow.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "明天我们要上线一个大版本。今天我们检查计划。我把部署写成文档，方便团队之后查看。如果监控失败，我们需要一个清晰的方案。我建议我们先检查发布分支。结果取决于部署批准，所以我检查了两遍。我把这个句型教给一位新队友：今天我想介绍……我围绕这个句型组织了一个完整的回答：这个项目的目标是……这一天以一份清晰的明日计划结束。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "deployment",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "部署，把应用发布到可运行环境的过程"
    },
    {
     "w": "monitoring",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "监控，持续观察系统状态和关键指标"
    },
    {
     "w": "Today I'd like to present ...",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "今天我想介绍……"
    },
    {
     "w": "The goal of this project is ...",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "这个项目的目标是……"
    },
    {
     "w": "release branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "发布分支，为准备新版本建立的分支"
    },
    {
     "w": "deployment approval",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "部署批准，发布生产环境前的人工确认"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I practice my short presentation for the team. Before we move on, Priya says, \"Here is the main result.\" In my update, I use the pattern naturally: This chart shows ... I suggest that we check the health check first. The result depends on the rollback, so I check it twice. I explain the production deploy to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the rollback plan. I check my notes and confirm the next step.",
   "tts": "I practice my short presentation for the team. Before we move on, Priya says, \"Here is the main result.\" In my update, I use the pattern naturally: This chart shows  I suggest that we check the health check first. The result depends on the rollback, so I check it twice. I explain the production deploy to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the rollback plan. I check my notes and confirm the next step.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我为团队演练了我的简短介绍。继续之前，Priya说：\"这是主要结果。\"在汇报里，我自然地用上了这个句型：这张图显示……我建议我们先检查健康检查。结果取决于回滚，所以我检查了两遍。我向一位新队友解释了生产部署。我们讨论了回滚计划相关的风险。我检查笔记，确认了下一步。",
   "hard": [
    {
