  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. I document the release checklist so the team can review it later. If the post-release check fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the production environment first. The result depends on the service outage, so I check it twice. I teach the pattern to a new teammate: One limitation is ... I build a full answer around the pattern: My recommendation is ... The checklist is done. The rollback plan is ready too.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. I document the release checklist so the team can review it later. If the post-release check fails, we need a clear plan. I suggest that we check the production environment first. The result depends on the service outage, so I check it twice. I teach the pattern to a new teammate: One limitation is  I build a full answer around the pattern: My recommendation is  The checklist is done. The rollback plan is ready too.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我给团队写了一份简短的总结。我把发布检查表写成文档，方便团队之后查看。如果发布后检查失败，我们需要一个清晰的方案。我建议我们先检查生产环境。结果取决于服务中断，所以我检查了两遍。我把这个句型教给一位新队友：一个局限是……我围绕这个句型组织了一个完整的回答：我的建议是……检查表完成了。回滚方案也准备好了。",
